      "urpx:forRatePlan": {
        "@id": "cpau:e-1"
      },
      "urpx:hasCoverageClaim": {
        "@id": "cpau:cc-e-1-2025-07-01",
        "@type": "urpx:CoverageClaim",
        "urpx:completenessResult": {
          "@id": "urpx:partial"
        },
        "urpx:selfContained": true,
        "urpx:explainedBy": {
          "@type": "urpx:Evaluation",
          "@id": "cpau:cc-e-1-2025-07-01-evaluation",
          "urpx:evaluationKind": {
            "@id": "urpx:coverageEvaluation"
          },
          "urpx:description": "This filing does not carry everything its source document states. 2 parts are deferred, listed here in the same words as the filing's tariff.toml [modeling].deferrals so the two records cannot drift. (1) Tier 1 quantity is denominated per day and prorated: Sheet E-1-1 Section D.2, \"a level of 15 kWh per day, prorated by Meter reading days of Service... for a 30-day bill, the Tier 1 level would be 450 kWh.\" cpau:tier-1-bracket carries upperBound 15 against cpau:ms-energy (unitOfMeasure urpx:kWh, no intervalDuration), and no tier name or description states the denomination, so the bound resolves as 15 kWh rather than 15 kWh/day. The per-day denomination IS expressible under v0.5.1 and was validated 2026-09-21: a daily-energy MetricInput whose MetricSpecification carries intervalDuration \"P1D\" and intervalType urpx:dailyInterval, pointed at by ServiceTiers.referencesMetricInput, conforms against the v0.5.1 shapes. It would be declarative at clj-urpx 0.25.0, whose ledger-metric-info (price.clj) surfaces only measurementKind, unitOfMeasure and flowDirection off a MetricSpecification. Work, not a blocker. (2) The proration arithmetic itself is not expressible: a Tier 1 bound of 15 kWh times the number of meter reading days (Sheet E-1-1 Section D.2, which refers the calculation to Rule and Regulation 11, a document not held in this corpus). ServiceBracketShape is sh:closed in v0.5.1 and lowerBound/upperBound are xsd:decimal literals with no formula or metric reference, so a bound that scales with billing-period length cannot be stated. Same class as urpx-org/urpx#32 (additive baseline allowance), open. Corpus-wide: pge/e-1, pge/e-tou-c, sce/d, sdge/dr and ladwp/r-1a all encode a daily allowance as a bare decimal on an undenominated kWh metric.",
          "urpx:evaluatedOn": "2026-09-22T00:00:00"
        }
      }
    },
    "urpx:ratePlanUniqueIdentifier": "E-1"
  },
  "urpx:hasRatePlanModifier": [
    {
      "@type": "urpx:RatePlanModifier",
      "@id": "cpau:e-hra",
      "urpx:name": "Electric Hydro Rate Adjuster",
      "urpx:initialEffectiveDate": "2023-01-01",
      "urpx:timezoneIdentifier": "America/Los_Angeles",
      "urpx:hasRatePlanModifierVersion": {
        "@type": "urpx:RatePlanModifierVersion",
        "@id": "cpau:e-hra-2023-01-01",
        "urpx:version": "2023-01-01",
        "urpx:changeReason": {
          "@id": "urpx:initial"
        },
        "urpx:modifierVersionNumber": "2023-01-01",
        "urpx:description": "A surcharge or discount applied to all CPAU electric rate schedules based on the strength of the City's hydrological generation portfolio. Applied to manage volatility in energy costs and the impact on customer rates. The adjustment value is determined annually in May (or when conditions warrant) by a 4x4 matrix of Hydro Stabilization Reserve level vs. projected hydro generation, and falls within the range ($0.066) credit to $0.048 surcharge per kWh. Applied upon Council approval.",
        "urpx:effectiveDateTime": "2023-01-01T00:00:00",
        "urpx:priceCurrency": "USD",
        "urpx:commodity": {
          "@id": "urpx:electricity"
        },
        "urpx:serviceRole": {
          "@id": "urpx:bundledServiceRole"
        },
        "urpx:applicableToRatePlan": [
          {
            "@id": "cpau:e-1"
          },
          {
            "@id": "cpau:e-1-tou"
          },
          {
            "@id": "cpau:e-2"
          },
          {
            "@id": "cpau:e-3"
          },
          {
            "@id": "cpau:e-4"
          },
          {
            "@id": "cpau:e-4-tou"
          },
